sequenceDiagram
    actor A1 as Customer A
    actor B1 as Customer B
    participant A as API
    participant D as Database
    Note over A1,B1: Both see 11:00 as free<br/>and click "Book" at the same moment
    A1->>A: Book 11:00
    B1->>A: Book 11:00
    A->>D: Save A's slot rows
    D-->>A: Saved
    A-->>A1: 201 Created
    A->>D: Save B's slot rows
    D-->>A: Rejected: slot already taken (unique index)
    A->>A: Try the next technician + bay pair, none left
    A-->>B1: 409 NO_AVAILABILITY + 3 nearest free times
    B1->>A: Book a suggested time
    A-->>B1: 201 Created
